    {
      "name": "Create Repo",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const random = Math.random().toString(36).substring(2);\r",
              "const repositoryName = \"My repository \" + random;\r",
              "\r",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"repositoryName\", repositoryName);"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "packages": {},
            "requests": {}
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status code is 201\", function () {\r",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);\r",
              "});\r",
              "\r",
              "pm.test(\"Repository name created\", function () {\r",
              "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();\r",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.name).to.eql(pm.variables.get(\"repo\"));\r",
              "});\r",
              "\r",
              "pm.test(\"Description created\", function () {\r",
              "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();\r",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.private).to.eql(true);\r",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "packages": {},
            "requests": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\r\n\"name\": \"{{repo}}\",\r\n    \"description\": \"To demonstrate Full Stack QA knowledge of APIs, Postman, Automated API tests, and CI/CD integration\",\r\n    \"private\": true\r\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseURL}}/user/repos",
          "host": [
            "{{baseURL}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "user",
            "repos"
          ]
        },
        "description": "ISSUE NOTES:\n\nI can see the issue. The **Create Repository** request is returning a `404 Not Found` error. Let me analyze what's wrong:\n\n1. **The URL has a trailing space**: `https://api.github.com/user/repos` — there's a space at the end of the URL, which can cause the request to fail. **\\[This was definitely an issue. doh!\\]**\n    \n2. **No** **`Authorization`** **header**: The GitHub API requires authentication to create a repository. The request has no headers set, even though a `github-token` variable is used elsewhere in the collection. **\\[I don't get this, because they were there\\]**\n    \n3. **No** **`Content-Type`** **header**: The body is JSON but there's no `Content-Type: application/json` header. **\\[I don't get this because it was defined when I checked\\]**\n    \n\nI wish it would let me do the fixes, so I can learn."
      },
      "response": []
    },
